  - ECG arrhythmia detection
abstract: >-
  A modular PyTorch library of 39 spiking neuron models across 8 families
  (H-LIF, MS-IF, Liquid, I-LIF, F-LIF, K-LIF, W-LIF, C-LIF) for neuromorphic
  edge computing research. Each family explores a different axis of spike
  generation, from hazard-based threshold mechanisms to information-theoretic,
  fractional-order, control-theoretic, transform-domain, and cardiac-biophysical
  approaches.
